  "question": {
    "text": "A person of mass <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></math> is sitting on a swing of length <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></math> and swinging with and angular amplitude <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo>.</mo></math> If the person stands up when the swing passes through its lowest point, the work done by him, assuming that his centre of mass moves by a distance <math><mi>l</mi><mi> </mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math> is close to:"
