  "solution": {
    "text": "From angular momentum conservation <br/><math><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>)</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mtd></mtr></mtable></math>  <br/>Now <br/><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi>l</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math>  <br/>Since <math><mi>l</mi><mo>≪</mo><mi>L</mi></math>  <br/><math><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi>l</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>l</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi>l</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mfrac><mrow><mi>l</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi>l</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>l</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mtd></mtr></mtable></math>  <br/>From SHM <br/><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ω</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow></mfrac></msqrt><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></msqrt><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></math>  <br/>Using this <br/><math><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi>l</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>×</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>l</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi>l</mi><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mtd></mtr></mtable></math>"
